sequenceDiagram
    participant A
    participant B as Backend
    participant C as Cache
    B->>+A: call into A
    alt cache hit and value fresh
        A->>C: get
        C-->>A: value
    else cache miss or stale entry
        A->>B: load
        B-->>A: data
    else
        A->>A: noop
    end
    A-->>-B: result
    Note over A,C: spanning note across all
    actor Z as Late actor
    B->>Z: notify
    activate Z
    Z-->>B: ok
    deactivate Z
